  "plugins": [
    {
      "name": "dsh-fast-mode",
      "title": {
        "en": "Fast Mode",
        "zh": "快速模式"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Per-conversation fast mode for multi-step tasks: batches independent tool calls and drops redundant steps. Pooled over 12 blocks and 138 valid pairs (10 task families): total wall clock about 18% faster (0.823x, per-cell median 0.799x, 95% CI 0.742-0.913, 93/138 pairs faster). On shapes it fits: codeimpl 0.704x (14/17), shellpipeline 0.699x; debugfix 1.032x and perfrefactor 1.009x are where it does not pay for itself.",
        "zh": "单会话开关的快速模式：合并可并行的工具调用、减少冗余步骤。12 块 138 对有效配对的合池结果：整任务总墙钟约快 18 %（0.823×，逐格中位 0.799×，95% 区间 0.742–0.913，138 对里 93 对更快）；适合的 codeimpl 0.704×（14/17 对更快）、shellpipeline 0.699×；debugfix 1.032×、perfrefactor 1.009× 是它收不回成本的地方。"
      },
      "icon": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/regrevia/dsh-fast-mode/main/icon.png",
      "author": "regrevia",
